<title>POLAND: Polish c.bank sells dlrs at 3.5220 zlotys - dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish c.bank sells dlrs at 3.5220 zlotys - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold dollars on the interbank market at 3.5220 zlotys, dealers said.</p>
<p>The intervention, which was carried out at 4.77 percent from the dollar parity rate for today, was medium-sized, they said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
